<list "Popping highlights,Popping mid+highlight,Preserve Darks only,2x everything,Late highlights,Custom" match "0,1,2,3,5,4" cvari _sofbuddy_lighting_overbright_profile atext "Pre-Curve : " noshade tip "Overbright-only pre-curve profile. The x2 combine preserves vanilla only where the curve is half. Late highlights (default) stays at half through 70% input, then lifts 80-100%; Popping highlights starts lifting at 70%; Popping mid+highlight at 60%; Preserve Darks only lifts harder; 2x everything is the stock identity look. Each profile writes its 11 values into the curve editor."><br>
<text "OB Pre-Curve..." tip "Open the Overbright Pre-Curve live editor." key mouse1 "sofbuddy_close_menu;sofbuddy_menu sof_buddy/lighting_overbright_curve_live" border 8 1 cyan regular align center><hbr>
